s  15. centaurs  sentinels are beings taken from greek  mythology that possess the upper body of  a human in the lower body of a horse  the biggest distinction between centaurs  of mythology and centaurs in harry  potter is that harry potter centrals are  gifted in divination a magical  discipline that allows one to gather  insights into future events i've seen  centaurs all over the hogwarts legacy  footage and they're known to inhabit the  forbidden forest near hogwarts  so i'm positive we'll get to interact  with them whether that will be a  positive or negative interaction is  unclear  and that's it for this video if you  enjoy the content please like the video  and subscribe to the channel what other  hogwarts legacy videos do you want until  next time remember it does not do to  dwell on dreams and forget to live  [Music]  you

